  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Ho Chi Minh City Integrated Emergency Communications System, through Business Council for International Understanding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Reverse Trade Mission would bring up to 10 Vietnamese delegates from the emergency management sector in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam to the United States to highlight U.S. technology and service capabilities for the development of an Integrated Emergency Communication System. The delegates would spend up to ten working days visiting U.S. regulators, policy makers, and private sector technology and service providers.</narrative>
  </description>
